{"articleNo":"195267","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=195267&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"취업준비생 대상 「寒여름 힐링캠프 」 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.07.23","hit":"5959","attachments":[{"name":"참가안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=195267&attachNo=79228"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">청년실업으로 인해 발생되는 다양한 사회적 문제와 취업준비생의 스트레스 해소 등을 위해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">국립공원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">중소기업진흥공단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">코레일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">자간 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">寒</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">여름 힐링캠프</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">」</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">를 운영할 계획이오니 취업준비생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 15.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -15.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"HEIGHT: 973px; WIDTH: 711px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/c5f81f5f-0cd8-49cc-8712-8917d88aad09.jpg\" width=\"1501\" height=\"2166\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">※ 참가신청 바로가기 ☞ 구글 설문지 응답(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://goo.gl/forms/X0l8zeJSK60Sr83J3\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">goo.gl/forms/X0l8zeJSK60Sr83J3</font></a>)</span></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
